    "html": "<p>An iceberg oscillates up and down in the sea with simple harmonic motion. At time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t=0\"></span> the iceberg is at the lowest point in its motion. At this instant its displacement is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-x_{0}\"></span> relative to the equilibrium sea level. The angular frequency of the iceberg is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the velocity of the iceberg at time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"ω {x}_{0}   c o s \\, ω t\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"ω {x}_{0}   s i n \\, ω t\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"- ω {x}_{0}   c o s \\, ω t\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"- ω {x}_{0}   s i n \\, ω t\"></span></li></ol>"
